-- Undercity: Would You Like Some Flies With That? (29360) - spawn the Fly Covered "Meat" on all six meat wagons
-- mop_world had 11 of the meat piles, on two of the six wagons (Trade Quarter east and the Rogues' Quarter
-- canal). The retail TDB 1210 and the Cataclysm Classic TDB 4.4.2 agree on 32 piles on six wagons, which
-- matches the quest's six map areas. This adds the 20 missing piles from the retail TDB (its 203407 is
-- a second pile on the exact spot of 203285 and is left out), sets the three piles whose entry differs
-- from the TDB to the TDB's entry (the two entries differ only in model), and gives all 31 the TDBs'
-- 120 s respawn instead of 300 s.
-- The guids 4100016-4100035 continue this branch's own block (4100001-4100015).

DELETE FROM `gameobject` WHERE `guid` BETWEEN 4100016 AND 4100035;

UPDATE `gameobject` SET `id`=208874 WHERE `guid`=180428;
UPDATE `gameobject` SET `id`=208876 WHERE `guid`=180429;
UPDATE `gameobject` SET `id`=208874 WHERE `guid`=180439;
UPDATE `gameobject` SET `spawntimesecs`=120 WHERE `id` IN (208874,208876);
